{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "004ter_401_2_4_004_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:242cd3bc371a5eb4c0d6c494a623af2ea111176351a83f851b35dcdb6dc4f524",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:004ter_401_2_4_004_01_09_a:2_4_004_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d73aecc4d9900fc8d99bf0cbfd37d590917537e9db82e4c1aec6eede7dafe579",
      "text": "……噢，●●●●プロデューサー？\n辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_401_2_4_004_01_09_a:2_4_004_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78bdf05d59dd35f9bacc945cac6fade48ce9b25f9cd2ac32d44e63ef82e93b7d",
      "text": "回想起前几天的演唱会，\n就突然想跟你聊聊。结果就打电话过来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_401_2_4_004_01_09_a:2_4_004_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ede49941a637a673964e24144907ace63760f054faf4535f5e2ef785d2753122",
      "text": "能陪我聊两句吗？\n……噢，谢啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_401_2_4_004_01_09_a:2_4_004_01_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd2c2102b2c8839f625fca7aae975fad9df1b7f34332fa1423e45608d9ea578f",
      "text": "粉丝的欢呼声很厉害吧！听着那些呼声，\n我就在想，原来当英雄就是这种感觉啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_401_2_4_004_01_09_a:2_4_004_01_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:704a324cd1846bc93ff948e0d1ca1adf9720b2a532c7beda80b9f8702369fa4d",
      "text": "想努力的心情蹭蹭地往外冒，\n感觉发挥出了超乎自己想象的力量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_401_2_4_004_01_09_a:2_4_004_01_09_a:cmd-000016:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49052fb7a557a5373abf4620fba329e77e63413620b6c8580ccf670cbc2b1569",
      "text": "是一场很棒的演唱会！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_401_2_4_004_01_09_a:2_4_004_01_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a511d5c7897295754677fde1776f7fadc684f5787b6b422e333254273e048938",
      "text": "哈哈！\n你在那场演唱会结束之后也说过一样的话呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_401_2_4_004_01_09_a:2_4_004_01_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c545b7890732900c8a9517e9b0d31119f61a49787de744424643e4b59d026f64",
      "text": "被在最近处注视着我的你这么一说，\n信心一下子就涌上来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_401_2_4_004_01_09_a:2_4_004_01_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2b2ca1c2d64546841818f7240098b44dcae85b9f4fd44933cda6a124b7eb154",
      "text": "一直以来都谢谢你啦，●●●●プロデューサー！\n今后也拜托你了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_401_2_4_004_01_09_a:2_4_004_01_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1592744698e4da14b5099efa3f96a8b354198fb1a00954daf38f1824a5b7abe2",
      "text": "为了回应你的期待，\n我今后也会继续加油的。然后把头号星抓在手中！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_401_2_4_004_01_09_a:2_4_004_01_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b71b493b0698c8a78f204633ae5b37e1570ef779b05e00035bed94e1835b40e",
      "text": "谢谢你听我说了这么多。\n那就在事务所见啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
